    {
      "text": "Full-page scan of a typewritten Russian-language page of World Health Assembly document A40/A/Conf.Paper No.7 Rev.1 (1987) on the global strategy for the prevention and control of AIDS; it contains further preambular paragraphs and operative paragraphs 1–7. The scan appears with inverted colours (white text on black).",
